      "bullets": [
        "Critical vulnerability allows remote code execution across Forgejo deployments <=16.0.3, exposing underlying host systems to arbitrary command execution.",
        "Self-hosted Git environments face host takeover, risking proprietary source code leakage, CI/CD supply chain tampering, and lateral network movement.",
        "DevOps and security teams must upgrade affected instances immediately, restrict network exposure, and inspect logs for unauthorized execution attempts."
      ]
